      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGHBORN HARRY (3) comes here in peak condition and looks ready to score a well-deserved win after he's savaged the line at this last three outings. Saved ground along the inside when he launched late for a game third over 1800m at this track last week. Should be able to put these away. THE STARS ALIGN (1) talented gelding who finds an easier contest today at his fourth run back. Outclassed when last to The Mona Lisa two-back in town, then shouldered the 60.5kg when fifth over 1600m at Newcastle a week ago. Capable of better over the extra journey. BINKOU (5) relished the big weight drop with a surprise victory at ($81) over this track and trip last week. Gets a better set-up here and another bold performance in expected. JOHNNY SMASH (6) eye-catching winner two-back at Wyong, then gave away too much start with a plugging sixth over 1800m here last week. Trained locally and gets a senior rider on today. Respect.",
